{"key": "Content/Scripts/NPCData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_2804::Text::1", "source_sha256": "268ec1e995694c87fb007e86f3388de2bd297a6fc5f82726079adc17ccc48db1", "target": "Bouldy, bu konuşmayı daha önce yaptığımızı hissettiğin oluyor mu?"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/NPCData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_2805::Text::1", "source_sha256": "b90e74b1f250856873256ff6dc3d49016fe63c884ca9d44f32635f9fa05f02df", "target": "Bunu bir ara yine yapalım, dostum Bouldy."}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/NPCData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_2806::Text::1", "source_sha256": "4d782e6a1ca85e153f35568755f379655c4641f79a57fce7d5a3110eb1b9f41b", "target": "Bu sefer bana bir öğüdün var mı, Bouldy?"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/NPCData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_2807::Text::1", "source_sha256": "7c0e8629015fa33545664febe7f1f9853239a2602156d947e47b8baef12b626a", "target": "Bouldy, aklına takılan bir şey varsa söyleyebilirsin, biliyorsun."}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/NPCData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_4215::Text::1", "source_sha256": "02af49c7428905cd7159f1fe4171ad33acaa2b1fe3e67463e9ae4278de8bc114", "target": "Hep yanımdasın, Bouldy! Sağ ol."}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/NPCData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_4216::Text::1", "source_sha256": "9e95dc73e7436a4db8709280a1ae42d589d99facda4847502b3bb4644d8c030f", "target": "Son zamanlarda işler nasıl gidiyor, Bouldy?"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/NPCData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_4217::Text::1", "source_sha256": "17cdd764783660fe68d59b88d35e2e0f39e43966ec365592811f3041c69c934f", "target": "Sisyphus’la ikiniz gayet iyi görünüyorsunuz, Bouldy."}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/NPCData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_4218::Text::1", "source_sha256": "e721806acb689e855534efdc53aff12b13711fb0b97193482d5749c3d3434ae4", "target": "Seni görmek her zamanki gibi güzel, Bouldy."}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/NPCData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_4219::Text::1", "source_sha256": "adac4cffeb2ad5e19e56fd8d02dd786f3422da66cbf35fd51be9a9c4674f913c", "target": "İyi bir dostsun, Bouldy. İyi ki buradasın."}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/NPCData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_4220::Text::1", "source_sha256": "b1cbadbbeda4069b9169795d0eac98b9f74f857e792dd6c122735e199490eaca", "target": "Aklına takılan bir şey olsa bana söylerdin, değil mi, Bouldy?"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/NPCData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_4221::Text::1", "source_sha256": "6269cbd73526e031bb514c26bcce808084ffc054cf3605e2d762aa09182fd9c6", "target": "Hey Bouldy, en sevdiğin renk ne?"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/NPCData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_4222::Text::1", "source_sha256": "6c8ffc205c5bdd3b04fe6e41628d44ebe2d652bd6194bd8d87273daf8449a086", "target": "Hey Bouldy, en çok neyle beslenmeyi seversin?"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/NPCData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_4223::Text::1", "source_sha256": "03271a491947c3c09dfa08087f81173e52fc9be8d76ab85698b8e78356335ce8", "target": "Hey Bouldy, boş vaktinde ne yapmayı seversin?"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/NPCData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_4224::Text::1", "source_sha256": "d0dfd9115177058eaf8b60588de5b053d3fc28b320b95d8b9f960039b5169508", "target": "Hey Bouldy, son zamanlarda ne var ne yok?"}
